{
  "id": "ss.relic.flare",
  "name": "Scent flare",
  "description": "A short incense stick set at a slant, bare timber at the handle and coated dark above it, its tip an ember with a white-hot point, and a ring of fire standing off the tip with seven licks of flame leaning off it — the ring made of two arcs of different radius and the licks unequal, so it is a burst and not a compass rose. The relic sends a ring of fire out of you on a timer, and a stick that burns down is the timer while the ring is what it sends. The ring is a hollow ring over a ring outline; the stick crosses behind it so the fire is in front, and the inside of the ring is warmed with a soft glow so the ember at its centre is a coal in a fire and not a pupil in an iris. The glows are the only soft things on the plate; every shape over them is solid.",
